    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone Creepy is a horror game about a women who is being stalked by someone and that stalker is going to take big steps to disrupt her life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of an office woman who lives in a complex with her friends, she works in an office where she works so diligently that she often falls asleep in her office, but there are things that bother her because she is followed by someone on her way home, in her suspicion the stalker begins to move to destroy her life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Feature</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conversation gameplay style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through the game by going through all the conversations to uncover the story and journey in the game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misleading Real Life Simulation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting, which is close to real life (office work, commuting, showering, eating), makes players unaware of the dangers lurking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game genre: Conversation, Horror, Walking simulator.</strong></u><br><u><strong>Average time to complete the game: 30 - 60 min</strong></u></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone Creepy is a horror game about a women who is being stalked by someone and that stalker is going to take big steps to disrupt her life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of an office woman who lives in a complex with her friends, she works in an office where she works so diligently that she often falls asleep in her office, but there are things that bother her because she is followed by someone on her way home, in her suspicion the stalker begins to move to destroy her life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Feature</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conversation gameplay style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through the game by going through all the conversations to uncover the story and journey in the game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misleading Real Life Simulation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting, which is close to real life (office work, commuting, showering, eating), makes players unaware of the dangers lurking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game genre: Conversation, Horror, Walking simulator.</strong></u><br><u><strong>Average time to complete the game: 30 - 60 min</strong></u></p>",
